Z||000000||JetroGT||12-21-1999||05:11 AM||||<BR>I was litterly digging through my glove compartment Sunday night when I realized that I had left my wallet at home and had no money to rent a movie. While I was on my quest to find enough change I found one of the tabs that is supposed to fit in between the sunroof and the metal of the car. When I looked on the back of it I found a part number. 20594101-----HPMI.<BR>Does any one know if this part is still available?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Monkeyman||12-21-1999||06:37 AM||||Sure is.  I just bought 2 new tabs and 2 new plastic washers (if you replace the tabs, replace the washers, too.  They go together.).  It cost me $13US at my local dealer.||||reg||1
Z||000002||JetroGT||12-21-1999||01:28 PM||||Finally. A part that I need that is still available!||||reg||10
